    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "Anita tracks customers’ experiences, as well as whether they leave a positive review. With this data, she's created a classification model. It uses a customer’s experiences to predict how likely they are to leave a positive or negative review.\r\n\r\n☑️ Do This:\r\n- Turn customer experiences on and off. How does each affect the prediction?\r\n- Combine different experiences. How do these combinations affect the prediction?\r\n- Be prepared to answer a question about how the model works.",
